 with external tools via skills and MCP servers\n- Manage subagents\n- Interact with Chrome\n- Create artifacts / implementation plans\nWhether you are performing deep research or building new applications, Antigravity offers a streamlined interface for all types of knowledge work.","name":"Antigravity","packageUrl":"https://antigravity.google/","privacyUrl":"https://policies.google.com/privacy","publisher":"Google","publisherSupportUrl":"https://antigravity.google/support","publisherUrl":"https://www.google.com/","purchaseUrl":"https://antigravity.google/pricing","releaseNotesUrl":"https://antigravity.google/changelog","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","artificial-intelligence","artificialintellicence","code","coding","develop","development","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"体验次世代智能体平台，开启飞跃之旅","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://antigravity.google/docs"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Antigravity 2.0 是您 AI 智能体的中央指挥中心，提供了一个统一的平台来启动、监控和编排它们的活动。与前身 Agent Manager 不同，Antigravity 2.0 是一个独立于 IDE 运行的应用程序。\n通过该界面，您可以同步或异步地编排智能体，以实现以下功能：\n- 执行系统命令\n- 进行文件读写操作\n- 开展网页搜索\n- 通过技能（Skills）和 MCP 服务器集成外部工具\n- 管理子智能体（Subagents）\n- 与 Chrome 浏览器交互\n- 创建制品（Artifacts）/ 实施计划\n无论您是进行深入研究还是构建新应用，Antigravity 都能为各类知识型工作提供流线型的操作界面。","privacyUrl":"https://policies.google.com/privacy?hl=zh-CN","tags":["人工智能","代码","大语言模型","开发","智能体","编程","自主智能"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://antigravity.google/support","publisherUrl":"https://www.google.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-14","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://antigravity.google/changelog","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"edff1f54721563da4e4a5159f59d5f83d91cc5c5","manifestVersion":"1.28.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/g/Google/Antigravity/2.32.1/Google.Antigravity.installer.yaml","sha256":"e2e0060b7c23c84d9df3c62fa3bf1f582378c06bf4976aeb47beeac0a921c499"},{"path":"manifests/g/Google/Antigravity/2.32.1/Google.Antigravity.